---
import LegalLayout from '../layouts/LegalLayout.astro';
import { siteConfig } from '../data/siteConfig';
---

<LegalLayout
  title={`Privacy Policy | ${siteConfig.metadata.siteName}`}
  description="How Seram Sound collects, uses, and protects the information you share — including details submitted through the contact form."
  heading="Privacy Policy"
  lastUpdated="June 12, 2026"
>
  <p>
    Your privacy matters. This policy explains, in plain language, what information
    {siteConfig.name} collects, why, and how it's handled. If anything here is unclear,
    reach out at <a href={`mailto:${siteConfig.email}`}>{siteConfig.email}</a> and I'll
    be glad to walk you through it.
  </p>

  <h2>What I collect</h2>
  <p>I only collect what's needed to respond to your inquiry and discuss your project:</p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Contact details</strong> — your name and email address.</li>
    <li><strong>Project details</strong> — anything you share about your project type, budget range, deadline, and creative direction.</li>
    <li><strong>Basic usage data</strong> — standard, anonymized analytics (such as pages visited) that help me understand how the site is used. This is never tied to your identity.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>How your information is used</h2>
  <p>Information you provide is used solely to:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Respond to your message and answer questions.</li>
    <li>Prepare a quote and discuss the scope of your project.</li>
    <li>Deliver and support work you've commissioned.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>I do not sell, rent, or trade your information, and I won't add you to marketing lists without your clear consent.</p>

  <h2>How the contact form works</h2>
  <p>
    Messages sent through the contact form are processed by a secure third-party form
    provider that delivers them to my inbox. That provider processes your submission only
    to relay it to me. If you'd rather not use the form, you can always email me directly at
    <a href={`mailto:${siteConfig.email}`}>{siteConfig.email}</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>Data retention</h2>
  <p>
    I keep inquiry and project correspondence for as long as it's needed to serve you and to
    meet legal or accounting obligations. If you'd like your information removed, just ask.
  </p>

  <h2>Your rights</h2>
  <p>
    Wherever you're located — and in line with regulations such as the GDPR and CCPA — you can
    request to:
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li>Access the personal information I hold about you.</li>
    <li>Correct anything that's inaccurate.</li>
    <li>Have your information deleted.</li>
    <li>Opt out of any non-essential communication.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    To make a request, email <a href={`mailto:${siteConfig.email}`}>{siteConfig.email}</a> and
    I'll respond promptly.
  </p>

  <h2>Cookies &amp; analytics</h2>
  <p>
    This site uses minimal, privacy-respecting analytics to understand general traffic patterns.
    It does not use invasive tracking or advertising cookies. Your browser settings let you control
    or block cookies at any time.
  </p>

  <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
  <p>
    This policy may be updated from time to time. When it changes, the "last updated" date above
    will reflect the revision. Material changes will be noted clearly.
  </p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>
    Questions about your privacy? Email <a href={`mailto:${siteConfig.email}`}>{siteConfig.email}</a>.
  </p>
</LegalLayout>
